<% hero = scene.active_player %><% game = scene.game_session %>Scene <%= scene.position %> of <%= game.scene_budget %>, <%= hero.name %>'s turn.<% ending = scene.ending %><% unless scene.first? %> Pick up where the last outcome stopped, without retelling it.<% unless ending %> The heroes do only what the players chose: where the way forks, the fork goes into the choices.<% end %><% end %><% if ending %><% if hero.character.hp.zero? %> <%= hero.name %> has fallen, their health spent. This is the last scene, and the story ends in <%= ending %>.<% else %> This is the last scene, and the story ends in <%= ending %>: <%= game.rolls.where(success: true).count %> of the <%= game.rolls.count %> rolls succeeded.<% end %> The ending is only what the choices and rolls so far bring about: no one, <%= game.party.map(&:name).to_sentence %> included, makes a move in it that those did not set up.<% if game.party.many? %> Each of them has a part in it: <%= game.party.reject(&:departed?).map { |player| "#{player.name} tried #{player.attempts.to_sentence.presence || "nothing"}" }.join("; ") %>.<% end %><% end %>
<%= hero.name %>, <%= hero.character.identity %>: <%= hero.character.sheet %>.
<% if (companions = scene.companions).any? %>In the scene with <%= hero.name %>: <%= companions.map { it.character.portrait }.join("; ") %>.
<% end %>